                    title:                  `Make It Stick`,
                    subtitle:               `You are the Clinical Innovation Lead. A digital sepsis-detection pathway cut mortality 18% on a six-month pilot. Fourteen earlier pilots looked just as good — and all died at scale. The board gives you one chance to embed this one trust-wide and make it stick at the 24-month review. Diagnose why pilots die, choose active translation tactics, fund the case against a £12M deficit, and routinize it so it survives the champion leaving.`,
                    header_tag:             `2 February 2026 · Brookfield NHS Foundation Trust · Embed the sepsis pathway — or join the graveyard of 14`,
