                    history_heading:        `Round-by-Round Record`,
                    chart_heading:          `Adoption, Sustainability & Engagement Trajectory`,
                    chart_start:            `Pilot`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (the Finance Director & a skeptical consultant)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Two clocks are running: the business case must clear the board on 30 April, and the 9-month checkpoint withdraws our funding if adoption is below 60%. But the real test is the 24-month review — eleven of our fourteen dead pilots were still “live” at nine months. A guideline and a launch webinar killed all fourteen. Show me the active tactics that reach the staff on the paper workaround, an investment case I can fund at 40% adoption, and an owner for this pathway who is not one tireless doctor.`,

